note agent_scout.jc: Scout, a desk researcher with tools and memory.
note Give it a real mind with: export JESUNCODE_AI_COMMAND="ollama run llama3.1"

to read_notes
    give back "Launch is Sep 30. Budget is 40k. Owner is Jesun."

to read_risks
    give back "Risk: venue not booked. Risk: budget approval pending."

agent scout
    persona is "You are Scout, a careful desk researcher. Answer briefly."
    tools are [read_notes, read_risks]
    remember is true
    steps are 10

ask scout "what is the launch date?" giving brief1
show brief1

ask scout "and the risks?" giving brief2
show brief2

ask scout "remind me of the date again" giving brief3
show brief3
